# The decode cache is local scratch: two q4 float blobs (371 MB) plus their
# metadata sidecars. The blobs are already excluded by the repository's *.npy
# rule; the sidecars describe those blobs and are meaningless without them, so
# the whole directory is ignored rather than leaving them loose in `git status`
# where another milestone could sweep them into an unrelated commit.
#
# Rebuild with: python src\03-build-cache.py
cache/
